      "id": "claim_2ee06b7826ed4c54847d665d635b3412",
      "statement": "AnimationTools.SkeletonBone collides with the built-in UnityEngine.SkeletonBone, and the codebase copes by aliasing rather than renaming: nine files outside the AnimationTools namespaces carry a using SkeletonBone = AnimationTools.SkeletonBone directive.",
