      "id": "claim_bae3b59208c84de6be43afd638728a13",
      "statement": "Bone-name heuristics in BoneNameConventions are best-effort fallbacks for rigs following the shipped BVH naming convention and are explicitly not a substitute for an explicit SkeletonBone reference where one is available.",
