    {
      "id": "claim_d7b4749a2aed464cbb4bb0409f5efede",
      "statement": "The skeleton root needs a custom dropdown because an imported model exposes only its top-level children as sub-assets — typically the mesh node and the topmost bone — so any deeper bone is unreachable from both the Project window and the object picker.",
