    {
      "id": "claim_13991d3bbd704b759b49920cbb3018fe",
      "statement": "The skeleton drawer intercepts drag-and-drop by hand instead of letting EditorGUI.ObjectField take the drop, because that control normalises a dragged sub-asset up to its model's main asset, which caused dropping an exposed bone node to assign the whole FBX.",
