    {
      "id": "claim_0da84c05e81349c7b35c5eeaec6711e1",
      "statement": "SkeletonData reports a pose/skeleton bone-count mismatch by throwing with an interpolated message rather than asserting, because the mismatch would otherwise surface as an IndexOutOfRangeException from inside NativeSlice with nothing naming the two things that disagreed; the interpolation forfeits the Burst compatibility the type advertises, a tradeoff the code acknowledges as real but currently unexercised.",
