      "id": "claim_5a0f2d96c0124fd58231e2d341871260",
      "statement": "The Assets/Scripts skeleton-UI trio — SkeletonUIManager, BoneSelectorWindow and SkeletonUIManagerEditor — is an unrelated 2D node-graph bone-picker in the global namespace that references neither AnimationTools.Skeleton nor AnimationTools.SkeletonBone, and BoneUIElements.cs is entirely commented out.",
